<div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-tighter">Bảng điều hành</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm font-medium">Theo dõi thời gian thực tình hình kinh doanh</p>
        </div>
        <button class="bg-teal-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl font-bold shadow-xl hover:bg-teal-700 transition flex items-center gap-3 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest" onclick="openModal('modal-qr')">
            <span>📷</span> QUÉT QR CHECK-IN
        </button>
    </div>
    <div class="flex bg-white rounded-2xl p-1 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 w-fit">
        <div class="branch-tab active" id="tab-central" onclick="switchBranch('central')">WorkHub Central Q1</div>
        <div class="branch-tab" id="tab-skyview" onclick="switchBranch('skyview')">WorkHub Skyview Q7</div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-[2rem] border-b-4 border-emerald-500 shadow-sm"><p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-black uppercase mb-1">💰 Doanh thu hôm nay</p><p class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-800" id="stat-revenue">3.4M</p></div>
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-[2rem] border-b-4 border-sky-500 shadow-sm"><p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-black uppercase mb-1">📅 Booking hôm nay</p><p class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-800" id="stat-bookings">18</p></div>
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-[2rem] border-b-4 border-orange-500 shadow-sm"><p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-black uppercase mb-1">🧑‍💻 Khách hiện tại</p><p class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-800" id="stat-occupied">07</p></div>
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-[2rem] border-b-4 border-indigo-500 shadow-sm"><p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-black uppercase mb-1">🏢 Phòng đang thuê</p><p class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-800" id="stat-rooms">04</p></div>
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-[2rem] border-b-4 border-red-500 shadow-sm bg-red-50/20"><p class="text-[10px] text-red-500 font-black uppercase mb-1">⚠️ Tiền tiềm năng (70% còn lại)</p><p class="text-2xl font-black text-red-600" id="stat-potential">2.8M</p><p class="text-[9px] text-red-400 font-bold" id="stat-potential-count">(5 đơn chờ check-in)</p></div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-800 mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest">📈 Doanh thu theo thời gian</h3><div class="h-48"><canvas id="revenueChart"></canvas></div></div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-800 mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest">📊 Số booking theo ngày</h3><div class="h-48"><canvas id="bookingChart"></canvas></div></div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-black text-slate-800 mb-4 uppercase tracking-tight text-sm">📅 Booking gần nhất</h3><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-left border-collapse"><thead class="bg-slate-50 text-[9px] uppercase text-slate-400 font-black"><tr><th class="p-3">Khách</th><th class="p-3">Phòng</th><th class="p-3">Thời gian</th><th class="p-3">Trạng thái</th><th class="p-3">Thanh toán</th></tr></thead><tbody class="text-[11px]" id="host-recent-table"></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-black text-slate-800 mb-4 uppercase tracking-tight text-sm">🏢 Trạng thái phòng</h3><div class="flex gap-2 mb-6 text-center text-[10px] font-black"><div class="flex-1 p-2 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg"><p class="text-slate-400">TỔNG</p><p class="text-base" id="room-total">20</p></div><div class="flex-1 p-2 bg-red-50 rounded-lg text-red-600"><p>THUÊ</p><p class="text-base" id="room-rented">12</p></div><div class="flex-1 p-2 bg-green-50 rounded-lg text-green-600"><p>TRỐNG</p><p class="text-base" id="room-free">8</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-2" id="host-floor-plan-mini"></div><button onclick="navigateTo('host_spaces')" class="w-full mt-6 py-2 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-[10px] font-black uppercase rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-200 transition">Quản lý phòng</button></div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-black text-xl text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-tighter mb-8">💰 Tài chính chi tiết</h3>
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
            <div><h4 class="font-bold text-slate-400 text-xs uppercase mb-4 tracking-widest">Phần A: Doanh thu thực</h4><div class="p-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100"><div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4"><span class="font-bold text-slate-500">Doanh thu thực:</span><span class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-800">10,000,000đ</span></div><div class="space-y-2 text-sm pt-4 border-t border-slate-200"><div class="flex justify-between"><span>🟢 Đã nhận (Cọc/Full):</span><span class="font-bold text-emerald-600">8,000,000đ</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span>⏳ Đang chờ xử lý:</span><span class="font-bold text-amber-500">2,000,000đ</span></div></div></div></div>
            <div><h4 class="font-bold text-red-400 text-xs uppercase mb-4 tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2">⚠️ Phần B: Tiền tiềm năng (70% còn lại)</h4><div class="p-6 bg-red-50/30 rounded-3xl border border-red-100"><div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4"><span class="font-bold text-red-600">Tổng tiềm năng:</span><span class="text-2xl font-black text-red-700">5,200,000đ</span></div><div class="h-24"><canvas id="potentialChart"></canvas></div><p class="mt-4 text-[9px] text-slate-500 font-bold italic uppercase">(*) Khoản này chỉ thu nếu khách đến</p></div></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>